The bbox reference placement implemented here follows the reference pipeline
published with "Krea 2 Registered Outpaint"
(https://huggingface.co/yijunwang2/krea2-outpaint), whose pipeline and helper
code are distributed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). No files from that repository
are included; the LoRA weights are not included and are licensed separately
under the Krea 2 Community License Agreement.

This pack contains no code from ostris/ComfyUI-Krea2-Ostris-Edit; it loads
that pack, installed separately by the user, at runtime.
